    ("هُدًى لِّلْمُتَّقِينَ", "هدى للمتقين", ["hudan lil-muttaqeen", "hudan lilmuttaqin"], "A guidance for those conscious of Allah"),
    ("ٱللَّهُ لَا إِلَٰهَ إِلَّا هُوَ ٱلْحَيُّ ٱلْقَيُّومُ", "الله لا إله إلا هو الحي القيوم", ["allahu la ilaha illa huwa al-7ayyu al-qayyoom", "allahu la ilaha illa huwal-7ayyul-qayyum"], "Allah - there is no deity except Him, the Ever-Living, the Sustainer of all existence"),
    ("لَا تَأْخُذُهُ سِنَةٌ وَلَا نَوْمٌ", "لا تأخذه سنة ولا نوم", ["la ta2khudhuhu sinatun wa la nawm", "la ta'khudhuhu sinatun wala nawm"], "Neither drowsiness overtakes Him nor sleep"),
    ("لَّهُ مَا فِي ٱلسَّمَاوَاتِ وَمَا فِي ٱلْأَرْضِ", "له ما في السماوات وما في الأرض", ["lahu ma fi al-samawati wa ma fi al-ard", "lahu ma fis-samawati wama fil-ard"], "To Him belongs whatever is in the heavens and whatever is on the earth"),
    ("وَسِعَ كُرْسِيُّهُ ٱلسَّمَاوَاتِ وَٱلْأَرْضَ", "وسع كرسيه السماوات والأرض", ["wasi3a kursiyyuhu al-samawati wal-ard", "wasi3a kursiyyuhus-samawati wal-ard"], "His Kursi extends over the heavens and the earth"),
    ("وَلَا يَؤُودُهُ حِفْظُهُمَا وَهُوَ ٱلْعَلِيُّ ٱلْعَظِيمُ", "ولا يؤوده حفظهما وهو العلي العظيم", ["wa la ya2ooduhu 7ifzuhuma wa huwa al-3aliyyu al-3azeem", "wala ya'uduhu 7ifzuhuma wahuwal-3aliyyul-3azim"], "And their preservation tires Him not, and He is the Most High, the Most Great"),
    ("لَا إِكْرَاهَ فِي ٱلدِّينِ", "لا إكراه في الدين", ["la ikraha fi al-deen", "la ikraha fid-deen"], "There shall be no compulsion in religion"),
    ("قَد تَّبَيَّنَ ٱلرُّشْدُ مِنَ ٱلْغَيِّ", "قد تبين الرشد من الغي", ["qad tabayyana al-rushdu mina al-ghayy", "qad tabayyanar-rushdu minal-8ayy"], "The right course has become clear from the wrong"),
    ("ٱللَّهُ وَلِيُّ ٱلَّذِينَ آمَنُوا", "الله ولي الذين آمنوا", ["allahu waliyyu alladheena amanoo", "allahu waliyyul-ladhina amanu"], "Allah is the Ally of those who believe"),
    ("يُخْرِجُهُم مِّنَ ٱلظُّلُمَاتِ إِلَى ٱلنُّورِ", "يخرجهم من الظلمات إلى النور", ["yukhrijuhum mina al-zulumati ila al-noor", "yu5rijuhum minaz-zulumati ilan-nur"], "He brings them out from darknesses into the light"),
    ("لَا يُكَلِّفُ ٱللَّهُ نَفْسًا إِلَّا وُسْعَهَا", "لا يكلف الله نفسا إلا وسعها", ["la yukallifu allahu nafsan illa wus3aha", "la yukallifullahu nafsan illa wus3aha"], "Allah does not charge a soul except with that within its capacity"),
    ("رَبَّنَا لَا تُؤَاخِذْنَا إِن نَّسِينَا أَوْ أَخْطَأْنَا", "ربنا لا تؤاخذنا إن نسينا أو أخطأنا", ["rabbana la tu2akhidhna in naseena aw akhta2na", "rabbana la tu'akhidhna in nasina aw a5ta2na"], "Our Lord, do not impose blame upon us if we have forgotten or erred"),
    ("وَٱعْفُ عَنَّا وَٱغْفِرْ لَنَا وَٱرْحَمْنَا", "واعف عنا واغفر لنا وارحمنا", ["wa3fu 3anna waghfir lana war7amna", "wa a3fu 3anna wa ighfir lana wa ir7amna"], "And pardon us; and forgive us; and have mercy upon us"),
    ("رَبَّنَا آتِنَا فِي ٱلدُّنْيَا حَسَنَةً", "ربنا آتنا في الدنيا حسنة", ["rabbana atina fi al-dunya 7asanah", "rabbana aatina fid-dunya hasanah"], "Our Lord, give us in this world that which is good"),
    ("وَفِي ٱلْآخِرَةِ حَسَنَةً وَقِنَا عَذَابَ ٱلنَّارِ", "وفي الآخرة حسنة وقنا عذاب النار", ["wa fi al-akhirati 7asanatan wa qina 3adhaba al-nar", "wafil-akhirati 7asanatan waqina 3adhaban-nar"], "And in the Hereafter that which is good and protect us from the punishment of the Fire"),
    ("رَبَّنَا لَا تُزِغْ قُلُوبَنَا بَعْدَ إِذْ هَدَيْتَنَا", "ربنا لا تزغ قلوبنا بعد إذ هديتنا", ["rabbana la tuzigh quloobana ba3da idh hadaytana", "rabbana la tuzi8 qulubana ba3da idh hadaytana"], "Our Lord, let not our hearts deviate after You have guided us"),
    ("وَهَبْ لَنَا مِن لَّدُنكَ رَحْمَةً إِنَّكَ أَنتَ ٱلْوَهَّابُ", "وهب لنا من لدنك رحمة إنك أنت الوهاب", ["wa hab lana min ladunka ra7matan innaka anta al-wahhab", "wahab lana min ladunka ra7matan innaka antal-wahhab"], "And grant us from Yourself mercy. Indeed, You are the Bestower"),
    ("حَسْبُنَا ٱللَّهُ وَنِعْمَ ٱلْوَكِيلُ", "حسبنا الله ونعم الوكيل", ["7asbuna allahu wa ni3ma al-wakeel", "hasbunallahu wani3mal-wakil"], "Sufficient for us is Allah, and He is the best Disposer of affairs"),
    ("رَبِّ زِدْنِي عِلْمًا", "رب زدني علما", ["rabbi zidnee 3ilma", "rabbi zidni 3ilman"], "My Lord, increase me in knowledge"),
    ("رَبِّ ٱشْرَحْ لِي صَدْرِي", "رب اشرح لي صدري", ["rabbi ishra7 lee sadree", "rabbish-ra7 li Sadri"], "My Lord, expand for me my breast"),
    ("وَيَسِّرْ لِي أَمْرِي", "ويسر لي أمري", ["wa yassir lee amree", "wayassir li 2amri"], "And ease for me my task"),
    ("وَٱحْلُلْ عُقْدَةً مِّن لِّسَانِي", "واحلل عقدة من لساني", ["wa7lul 3uqdatan min lisanee", "wa u7lul 3uqdatan min lisani"], "And untie the knot from my tongue"),
    ("يَفْقَهُوا قَوْلِي", "يفقهوا قولي", ["yafqahoo qawlee", "yafqahu qawli"], "That they may understand my speech"),
