    ("رَبَّنَا آتِنَا مِن لَّدُنكَ رَحْمَةً", "ربنا آتنا من لدنك رحمة", ["rabbana atina min ladunka ra7mah", "rabbana aatina min ladunka rahmah"], "Our Lord, grant us from Yourself mercy"),
    ("وَهَيِّئْ لَنَا مِنْ أَمْرِنَا رَشَدًا", "وهيئ لنا من أمرنا رشدا", ["wa hayyi2 lana min amrina rashada", "wahayyi' lana min amrina rashadan"], "And prepare for us from our affair right guidance"),
